{"id":"mobile-datovka","name":"Mobile Datovka","tagline":"A free graphical user interface for data boxes","blurb":"This is a community package of Mobile Datovka and not officially supported by CZ.NIC.","description":"This is a community package of Mobile Datovka and not officially supported by CZ.NIC.\n\nDatovka is a multiplatform mobile application for accessing data boxes.\nA data box is an electronic storage site in Czech Republic. It is intended\nfor delivery of official documents and for communication with public\nauthority bodies.\n\nMobile Datovka allows receiving and sending of data messages together with\nsome useful functions.","developer":"CZ.NIC, z.s.p.o.","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/icons/128x128/cz.nic.mobile-datovka.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-1_224x497@1.png","w":405,"h":900},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-2_224x497@1.png","w":405,"h":900},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-3_224x497@1.png","w":405,"h":900},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/cz/nic/mobile-datovka/1080cc0791bed1c3640eb1d26b7a2573/screenshots/image-4_224x497@1.png","w":405,"h":900}],"categories":["Graphics & Design","Communication"],"tags":["office","email"],"license":"GPL-3.0-or-lat